<BaseLayout
  title="About The UK Punter — How We Research & Compare Casinos"
  description="How The UK Punter compares casinos: published terms, UKGC register data and certified RTP figures. UKGC-licensed operators only. Our methodology explained."
>
  <article class="article-wrap">
    <h1>About The UK Punter</h1>
    <div class="article-body">
      <p>
        The UK Punter is an independent comparison site for UK players. We compare online
        casinos on the factors players actually care about — withdrawal policies, certified RTP
        figures, minimum deposits, payment methods and bonus terms — and we only ever feature
        operators licensed by the <strong>UK Gambling Commission</strong>.
      </p>

      <h2>What we are — and what we are not</h2>
      <p>
        The UK Punter is an <strong>aggregator and comparison website</strong>: we publish
        independent reviews of multiple third-party gambling operators, compare their published
        terms, and link to their official websites. We are <strong>not a gambling
        operator</strong>. No betting, gaming or wagering takes place on this site; we do not
        accept deposits, hold player funds, offer casino games or process gambling transactions.
        All gambling services are provided by the operators themselves, on their own websites,
        under their own UK Gambling Commission licences.
      </p>

      <h2>Our research methodology</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Published terms, read in full.</strong> We review each operator's complete cashier terms and bonus conditions, and flag wagering requirements, game weightings, max bets and win caps.</li>
        <li><strong>Regulator data first.</strong> Licence status is verified against the UK Gambling Commission's public register, and industry benchmarks come from the regulator's published market data.</li>
        <li><strong>Certified figures only.</strong> RTP numbers are taken from provider-certified game information, never from marketing material.</li>
        <li><strong>Regular re-checks.</strong> Terms change constantly. Comparison pages display a "last updated" date and are re-checked regularly.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we make money</h2>
      <p>
        The UK Punter is currently a non-commercial information site: operators do not pay to
        be featured, and the site contains no paid placements or tracked affiliate links. If
        commercial relationships are introduced in future, they will be clearly disclosed on
        every affected page — and they will never change how we rank or describe an operator.
      </p>

      <h2>Our commitment to safer gambling</h2>
      <p>
        We believe honest information makes gambling safer. Every page on this site links to
        free support services, and we explain restrictions like stake limits and affordability
        checks factually — because informed players make better decisions. If gambling has
        stopped being fun, visit our <a href="/responsible-gambling/">responsible gambling page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
